		text = "Everything in a District that isn't inside the Nest's walls is the Backstreets. Most people in the City live here, in alleys so tangled that a short trip by car can take all afternoon. The streets are damp, crowded and loud: noodle stalls, Workshops, academies, laundries and Fixer offices, all stacked on top of each other.\n\nNobody runs the Backstreets. The Wing protects its Nest, not you. What keeps a street alive is whatever it can pay for: a Syndicate's protection, a Fixer office down the road, a neighborhood watch of locals with lamps and whistles.\n\nAnd every night at 3:13, the Sweepers come. Be home before then.",
