		text = "Long before Lobotomy Corporation, the Wings went to war with each other. People call it the Smoke War. An older L Corp, a different company from the one that came later, was one of the main sides, and the old G Corp of District 7 fought on the front lines with weapons nobody likes to describe. G Corp did not survive the peace.\n\nThe war is history now, the kind grandparents keep in locked boxes. Veterans rarely talk about it, and they don't have to. Just having a record of fighting in it, on either side, can be enough to have Nest residence refused for the rest of your life.",
